# PC NAS
###################################################
scrape-bazos.exe search --category pc --keyword 'nas' --details-all

Analyze data in attached json file
 * If price field does not have value, check 'full_description' field and parse value e.g. Cena 27 €.
 * provide list of NAS solutions items worth of money (also include link from url field)
   and provide reason why you pick it
 * if provided in description also list:
    - CPU type, number cores and generations
    - RAM size and ddr type
    - STORAGE size
    - if is suitable for running proxmox jellyfin encoding

